# [ecosystem-name]-shared — Claude Code Context

## Purpose

Single source of truth for everything shared across the [EcosystemName] ecosystem.
Contains no runnable code — only specifications, schemas, and documentation.

## Repo map

```
[ecosystem-name]-shared/
├── protocols/      Wire protocol schemas (if applicable)
├── data-format/    Data exchange format specifications (if applicable)
├── shaders/        Shared rendering constants and math (if applicable)
└── docs/           Domain knowledge, architecture, ADRs
    └── adr/        Architecture Decision Records
```

## Consumption by platform

| Platform | Language | How to consume |
|----------|----------|----------------|
| [App 1] | [Language] | [How] |
| [App 2] | [Language] | [How] |

## Adding content

- **New protocol message**: add schema, bump version in `protocols/README.md`,
  update all platform implementations.
- **Architectural decision**: add ADR to `docs/adr/` using `000-template.md`.
- **Discovered inconsistency**: add entry to `docs/known-inconsistencies.md`.

## Protocol versioning

All wire messages carry a `version` field (semver). Breaking changes increment
the major version. Current version: `1.0.0`.
